{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#card-zh","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 是一个面向 Web 配置的 DSH 微信通道插件，让用户通过手机微信与 DSH agent 对话。插件接入 DSH 的 agents 服务，为每个微信 conversation 建立并复用 agent 会话，将收到的文字作为用户消息交给 agent，等待处理后把回复返回微信。它支持按对话保持上下文、选择默认或指定的模型 provider 与 model，并可设置 agent 工作目录；微信消息由 weixin-agent-sdk 接收，插件随 DSH 进程启动。适合希望从微信继续使用 DSH agent 的用户。使用前需完成微信登录，并使用 DSH 已配置的模型凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:51-80","index.js:83-96","index.js:108-123"]}
{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#card-en","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-weixin connects WeChat chats to DSH agents. It reuses an agent session per conversation, forwards messages, and returns replies. Configure a provider, model, or working directory; DSH defaults apply otherwise. It runs with DSH and requires WeChat login and DSH model credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:51-80","index.js:83-96","index.js:108-123"]}
