{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#feature-1","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 的功能「微信消息对话」：它把微信收到的文字交给 DSH agent，并将 agent 的最终文本回复返回给微信；处理异常时会返回错误文本。消息通过 weixin-agent-sdk 的 chat 接口接入。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:83-97","index.js:108-117"]}
{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#feature-2","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 的功能「按对话维持上下文」：首次收到 conversationId 消息时创建 DSH agent，后续复用；clearSession 会释放会话，插件卸载时清理全部会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-53","index.js:63-80","index.js:99-105","index.js:119-123"]}
{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#feature-3","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 的功能「选择 agent 模型」：管理员可在插件配置中填写 provider 和 model；未填写的字段沿用 DSH 当前默认模型选择。新建对话 agent 时使用选定的模型配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-28","index.js:55-60","index.js:67-75"]}
{"unit_id":"wendayuan__dsh-weixin#feature-4","repo":"wendayuan/dsh-weixin","commit":"02e9ab2da91a9cac20e51abf619759052843a3df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 的功能「设置 agent 工作目录」：可通过 cwd 配置新建 agent 的工作目录；没有设置时使用启动 DSH 的当前目录。该目录随 agent 创建请求传入。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-24","index.js:67-72"]}
